-foreground","children":"Turning an intention into a plan with an order to it: what has to be registered, what has to be in place before you take on customers or staff, what the running obligations will be, and roughly what each stage costs. Useful before you commit money, and often before you commit to a structure."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-l-2 border-primary/40 pl-3 text-sm italic text-secondary","children":["“","What has to happen, and in what order?","”"]}]]}],["$","li","Growth and expansion planning",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"03"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Growth and expansion planning"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"What changes when a business adds a location, a second line of activity, a partner or outside investment. The practical questions are usually about ownership, control, documentation and which obligations get triggered at what size."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 border-l-2 border-primary/40 pl-3 text-sm italic text-secondary","children":["“","What breaks if we grow, and what should we fix first?","”"]}]]}],["$","li","Operational and process guidance",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"04"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Operational and process guidance"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Reviewing how a business currently runs day to day, where records and approvals are being kept informally, and which of those gaps will cause a real problem later, at a bank, in a tender, in a due-diligence exercise or at an assessment."}],"$L32"]}],"$L33","$L34"]}]]}]}]
